---
title: obsidian-kglite loop
---
flowchart TB
  accTitle: vault to graph and back
  accDescr: A vault is read into a property graph. The graph answers queries, produces a health report and serves MCP; it writes back as a canvas, a skipped backlinks index, or a sealed export.
  vault["Obsidian vault<br/>Markdown · links · tags"]
  build["okf check / build<br/>read-only"]
  kg[".kgl graph<br/>notes · sections · chunks"]
  vault -->|read| build --> kg
  subgraph outputs["consume the graph"]
    direction LR
    cypher["Cypher"]
    report["health report"]
    mcp["MCP server"]
  end
  subgraph writeback["write back to the vault"]
    direction LR
    canvas["Graph.canvas<br/>not parsed"]
    bl["Backlinks.md<br/>kg_skip"]
    exp["sealed export<br/>reconciled"]
  end
  kg --> cypher
  kg --> report
  kg --> mcp
  kg -.-> canvas
  kg -.-> bl
  kg -.-> exp
  canvas -.-> vault
  bl -.-> vault
  exp -.-> vault
  classDef zero fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,color:#1b5e20
  classDef tree fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100,color:#bf360c
  class canvas,bl zero
  class exp tree
